    "Checking…": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wird geprüft…"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認中…"}}}},
    "Choose": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auswählen"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選択"}}}},
    "Choose CLI executable": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CLI-Programm auswählen"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CLI実行ファイルを選択"}}}},
    "Choose…": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auswählen…"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選択…"}}}},
    "CLI default": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CLI-Standard"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CLIのデフォルト"}}}},
    "CLI documentation": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CLI-Dokumentation"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CLIドキュメント"}}}},
    "Currently free": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Derzeit kostenlos"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"現在無料"}}}},
    "Default effort": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Standard-Effort"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"デフォルトのエフォート"}}}},
    "Executable": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Programm"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実行ファイル"}}}},
    "Free for a limited time": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zeitlich begrenzt kostenlos"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"期間限定で無料"}}}},
    "High": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoch"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高"}}}},
    "Incompatible": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nicht kompatibel"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"互換性なし"}}}},
    "Installed and authenticated.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installiert und angemeldet."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"インストール済みで認証されています。"}}}},
    "Low": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Niedrig"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"低"}}}},
    "Max": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maximum"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最大"}}}},
    "Medium": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mittel"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中"}}}},
    "Minimal": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minimal"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最小"}}}},
    "Models and model-specific effort levels are loaded from the signed-in Codex CLI and refreshed automatically.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modelle und modellspezifische Effort-Stufen werden aus der angemeldeten Codex-CLI geladen und automatisch aktualisiert."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"モデルとモデル固有のエフォートレベルは、サインイン済みのCodex CLIから読み込まれ、自動的に更新されます。"}}}},
    "Models are loaded from the signed-in Antigravity CLI. Effort can be set to Low, Medium, or High.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Modelle werden aus der angemeldeten Antigravity-CLI geladen. Effort kann auf Niedrig, Mittel oder Hoch gesetzt werden."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"モデルはサインイン済みのAntigravity CLIから読み込まれます。エフォートは低、中、高に設定できます。"}}}},
    "Free models are loaded dynamically from OpenCode Zen. Offers can change or end at any time.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kostenlose Modelle werden dynamisch aus OpenCode Zen geladen. Angebote können sich jederzeit ändern oder enden."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無料モデルはOpenCode Zenから動的に読み込まれます。提供内容はいつでも変更または終了する場合があります。"}}}},
    "Not installed": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nicht installiert"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未インストール"}}}},
    "Not live-tested": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nicht live getestet"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ライブテスト未実施"}}}},
    "Only the workflow instruction and transcript text are sent. Each request runs non-interactively in a temporary folder with tools, sessions, project rules, and update checks disabled where the CLI supports it.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gesendet werden nur die Workflow-Anweisung und der Transkripttext. Jede Anfrage läuft nicht interaktiv in einem temporären Ordner; Tools, Sitzungen, Projektregeln und Update-Prüfungen werden deaktiviert, soweit die CLI dies unterstützt."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"送信されるのはワークフローの指示と文字起こしテキストだけです。各リクエストは一時フォルダで非対話的に実行され、CLIが対応している場合はツール、セッション、プロジェクトルール、更新確認が無効になります。"}}}},
    "OpenAI account via Codex": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenAI-Konto über Codex"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex経由のOpenAIアカウント"}}}},
    "Free OpenCode Zen models via your existing login": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kostenlose OpenCode-Zen-Modelle über deine bestehende Anmeldung"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"既存のログインによる無料OpenCode Zenモデル"}}}},
    "Ready": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bereit"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"準備完了"}}}},
    "Review Zen privacy and pricing": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zen-Datenschutz und Preise prüfen"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zenのプライバシーと料金を確認"}}}},
    "Setup guide": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einrichtungsanleitung"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"セットアップガイド"}}}},
    "Sign-in required": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anmeldung erforderlich"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"サインインが必要"}}}},
    "Some free OpenCode Zen models may use prompts and completions for training. Do not send personal or confidential data unless the selected model's terms allow it.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Einige kostenlose OpenCode-Zen-Modelle dürfen Prompts und Antworten zum Training verwenden. Sende keine persönlichen oder vertraulichen Daten, sofern die Bedingungen des gewählten Modells dies nicht erlauben."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一部の無料OpenCode Zenモデルでは、プロンプトと回答が学習に使用される場合があります。選択したモデルの条件で許可されていない限り、個人情報や機密情報を送信しないでください。"}}}},
    "The Antigravity model list could not be refreshed. The last cached list remains available.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Antigravity-Modellliste konnte nicht aktualisiert werden. Die zuletzt gespeicherte Liste bleibt verfügbar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Antigravityのモデル一覧を更新できませんでした。最後に保存された一覧は引き続き使用できます。"}}}},
    "The Codex model list could not be refreshed. The last cached list remains available.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Codex-Modellliste konnte nicht aktualisiert werden. Die zuletzt gespeicherte Liste bleibt verfügbar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codexのモデル一覧を更新できませんでした。最後に保存された一覧は引き続き使用できます。"}}}},
    "The OpenCode Zen model list could not be refreshed. The last cached list remains available.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die OpenCode-Zen-Modellliste konnte nicht aktualisiert werden. Die zuletzt gespeicherte Liste bleibt verfügbar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenCode Zenのモデル一覧を更新できませんでした。最後に保存された一覧は引き続き使用できます。"}}}},
    "Support follows the documented Antigravity headless CLI contract. No signed-in installation was available for a live test.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Unterstützung folgt dem dokumentierten Headless-CLI-Vertrag von Antigravity. Für einen Live-Test war keine angemeldete Installation verfügbar."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"サポートは文書化されたAntigravityヘッドレスCLIの仕様に準拠しています。ライブテストに使用できるサインイン済みの環境はありませんでした。"}}}},
    "The CLI is installed, but no signed-in account was detected.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die CLI ist installiert, aber es wurde kein angemeldetes Konto erkannt."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CLIはインストールされていますが、サインイン済みアカウントが見つかりません。"}}}},
    "The CLI was not found in common installation locations.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die CLI wurde an den üblichen Installationsorten nicht gefunden."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一般的なインストール先にCLIが見つかりません。"}}}},
    "Ultracode": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ultracode"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ウルトラコード"}}}},
    "Use automatic detection": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatische Erkennung verwenden"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動検出を使用"}}}},
    "Use the accounts already signed in to supported provider CLIs. No separate API key is stored in TypeWhisper.": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verwende die Konten, mit denen du bereits in unterstützten Anbieter-CLIs angemeldet bist. TypeWhisper speichert keinen separaten API-Key."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"対応するプロバイダーCLIですでにサインインしているアカウントを使用します。TypeWhisperに別のAPIキーは保存されません。"}}}},
    "Version": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Version"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"バージョン"}}}},
    "XHigh": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sehr hoch"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"非常に高"}}}}
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
